and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It's important to be polite when you ask for something or respond to requests.<br>You can make a request by using: <span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>can you ... ?</li> <li>could you ... ?</li> <li>will you ... ?</li> <li>would you mind ... ?</li></ul></span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you drop me off at the intersection of Holyoke and Mt Auburn Street?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure. Let me help you with your bags.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you take Storrow Drive instead?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Of course. Storrow Drive is faster than the interstate.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Comparative and Superlative Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class=\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing. </br>You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class=\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Storrow Drive is shorter than the interstate, but the interstate is the fastest route.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You use <span class=\"strong\">than</span> after comparatives.</li> <li>You add <span class=\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things.</li></ul>  </p>Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and the superlative:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shorter (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the shortest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"late\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"later (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"heavy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"heavier (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expensive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more expensive (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most expensive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good</br> bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)</br> worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best</br> the worst\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to drop off ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to bring a person to a certain destination", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you drop me off at the intersection of First and Main St?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk to a taxi driver.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fee ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the price you pay for a service; surcharge", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a $2 fee to exit the airport.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "toll", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the price you pay to use a particular road or structure", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a toll on the interstate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "interstate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a system of highways in the USA", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We could take the interstate and turn right at the bridge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flat rate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a fixed price for a taxi ride", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The taxi offers a $40 flat rate to Cambridge from the airport.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tunnel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an underground passage through a hill or river", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We could take the Sumner Tunnel to get to Storrow Drive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "meter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a device that shows how much the taxi fare is", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's cheaper to use the meter right now. The traffic is very light.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "route", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a way to get to a destination from a starting point", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What's the fastest route to get to Holyoke Street?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, write a dialogue (10 to 12 lines) between a cab driver and a passenger.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask the cab driver for different routes to the airport from your home.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare the different routes and decide on the best way to get to the airport.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue with a cabbie.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use comparative and superlative adjectives to describe things and people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make and respond to requests.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about travel and transportation.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make and res